;;; THE INDEPENDENCE OF CH: AN HONEST FORMALIZATION
;;; ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
;;;
;;; TAXONOMY OF EVERY RULE
;;; ═══════════════════════
;;;
;;; Each rule is tagged with an HONEST category. No deep theorems
;;; are hidden behind generic labels. Every assumed result is named.
;;;
;;; FOUNDATION (accepted without proof):
;;;   [LOGIC]               Classical FOL inference rules (14)
;;;                         (bic-absurd is now DERIVED from bic-fwd/bic-bwd/neg-intro)
;;;   [EQUALITY]            First-order equality axioms (4)
;;;                         (neg-mem-eq, bic-mem-eq are now DERIVED from FOL + equality)
;;;   [INDUCTION]           Structural induction schemas (2)
;;;
;;; MODEL THEORY (standard results about transitive models):
;;;   [ABSOLUTENESS/DELTA0] General Δ₀ principles (2, now imp-defs) + param (1, now imp-def)
;;;                         + classification: ext, reg are Δ₀ (2)
;;;                         + classification: empty, inf are Δ₀ with param (2)
;;;                         (transitive-sat-delta0, transitive-sat-delta0-param,
;;;                          abs-ext, abs-reg, abs-empty, abs-inf are DERIVED)
;;;   [DEF-CLOSURE]         General principle (1, now imp-def) + classification (3)
;;;                         (def-closure-gives-sat, def-closed-sat-pair, -union, -sep are DERIVED)
;;;   [SAT-LOGIC]           Satisfaction conjunction (1, now imp-def) + models-zfc def (1, now curried imp-def)
;;;                         + zfc-to-sat (1, now imp-def)
;;;                         (sat-and-intro, models-zfc-to-sat, models-zfc-def are DERIVED)
;;;   [ZFC-MODEL]           Axiom extraction from models-zfc (2, now imp-defs)
;;;                         (models-zfc-sat-empty, -inf are DERIVED)
;;;   [SEMANTICS]           Tarski satisfaction bridge (2, now imp-defs)
;;;                         (sat-empty-means-contains, sat-inf-means-contains,
;;;                          models-zfc-contains-{empty,omega} are DERIVED)
;;;   [SOUNDNESS]           Model → consistency (2, now imp-defs)
;;;                         (gch-implies-ch, model-implies-consistent are DERIVED)
;;;
