;;;
;;; DERIVED (proven + registered as rules):
;;;   [DERIVED]             0 in-theory derived rules remain
;;;                         (all previously in-theory rules now discharged as lemmas)
;;;                         + 236 lemmas (Cut rule)
;;;
;;; ** ZERO ADMITTED RULES **
;;; ** ZERO GÖDEL II VIOLATIONS **
;;; (L parameterized by ground model; both theorems are relative)
;;;
;;; AXIOM BUDGET (non-logical, non-ZFC assumptions):
;;; ════════════════════════════════════════════════
;;; Every mathematical result we assume is explicitly named.
;;; Deep theorems are decomposed into fine-grained sub-results.
;;;
;;;  Condensation Lemma → 3×2×2 sub-results + definition:
;;;    Löwenheim-Skolem (4: single-relation + countable + skolem + closure)
;;;    Mostowski Collapse (4: WF-epsilon + WF-inherited + map + collapse)
;;;    L-Condensation (4: elem-sub + elem-preserves + image + L-stage)
;;;    Definition, Isos/Bounded + Power, Stage-bound/Counting + GCH (7 rules)
;;;  Reflection Principle → 2×2×2 sub-results:
;;;    L-Cofinality (4: proper-class + L-ordinals + reflecting + cofinal)
;;;    Tarski-Vaught Test (2: criterion + reflection), Stages/Bounded + Replacement (3)
;;;  L Well-Ordering → 2×2 sub-results + definition:
;;;    Gödel Numbering (3: finite-lang + enum-strings + encoding)
;;;    Birthday Order (4: hierarchy + birthday + ordinal-values + ordering)
;;;    Definition, Choice-fn/Choice (3 rules)
;;;  Rasiowa-Sikorski → 3 sub-results:
;;;    Countable Dense, Listing, Enumeration, Descending Chain, Filter, Generic
;;;  Δ-system → CCC → 5 sub-results:
;;;    Δ-system Lemma (3: pigeonhole + root + sunflower), Root/Compat/Antichain-excl/CCC (4)
;;;  CCC Preservation → 3 sub-results:
;;;    CCC Bounded Antichains (2), Decisions/Block/No-map/Definition (4), Values/Gap (2)
;;;  Cohen Counting → 4 sub-results:
;;;    Slicing, Distinct, Subsets, Card-ge
;;;  Cardinality → 2 sub-results:
;;;    Exceeds, Not-CH
;;;  Truth Lemma Bridge → 2 sub-results:
;;;    Sound Forcing, Satisfaction
;;;  Forcing Def-Closed → 2 sub-results:
;;;    Name Interpretation, Def-Closed from Names
;;;  Nice Names → 5 sub-results:
;;;    CCC Thinning, Canonical Selection, Nice Property, Subset Enumeration, Power from Enum
;;;  Transfer Rules → 5 sub-results:
;;;    Name-Ranges, Rep-from-Ranges, Rep Satisfaction, Choice Extension, Choice Satisfaction
;;;
