;;;     1-premise (auto 3): name-interpretation-gives-def-closed
;;;   - Wave 7 models-zfc-def recovery (Phase 19 Wave 7): 1 lemma
;;;     10-premise models-zfc-def → zero-premise curried imp-def (models-zfc-conj-def)
;;;     + recovery via 10-level mp chain. LAST multi-premise rule converted.
;;;   - Cohen: cohen-is-poset (from ffp) + 6 infrastructure + theorem
